{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41602","headline":"僻居秋思寄友人 · 伍乔","name":"僻居秋思寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门巷秋归更寂寥，雨余闲砌委兰苗。\n梦回月夜虫吟壁，病起茅斋药满瓢。\n泽国旧游关远思，竹林前会负佳招。\n身名未立犹辛苦，何许流年晚鬓凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}